cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference the Born-Agentic Organization model, please cite this repository as below."
title: "Born-Agentic Organization"
abstract: >-
  Born-Agentic Organization is a Role-first organizational model for AI-native
  companies. The persistent unit of the organization is the Role, not the
  Employee, not the Agent, and not the Model. Role Agents can begin working
  before humans are hired, detect Capability Gaps, request human collaborators
  through Machine-Initiated Hiring, and preserve organizational memory across
  employee turnover. This repository contains the concept, reference
  architecture and v0.1 specifications.
